description	"Komad Fortuna

A traditional hunter with a strategic mind.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Snare Trip Mines (3)
-- Pulls/Slows/Pulses On Det
- Sonic Grenade (1)
- Czerka High-Caliber Rifle
-- 2 shots per reload
-- 7% faster RoF
-- 20% Lower Damage
-- 30% faster reload
-- Knocksdown On Hit

^6Inventory:
- Electrobinoculars ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Healing (3)
- Tracking Beacon
- Dexterity (1)
- Knockdown Roll
- Blast Armor 
- Anti MT (1)

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]
- Wrist Laser ^3[CS2]
-- Tracks On Hit, 50% Less Damage
- Cloak (1) ^3[CS3]"
